== CANON-8: the divisor is the constant 0, so this is a compile-time error even
== though the dividend is only known at run time. (Accepted before v3.18.)
Module Diagnostics.VariableModLiteralZero

Main :
    A Integer := 10
    PutLn(A mod 0)
;
